        <mxCell id="Yvl_u48jdwtjXfyFhl5y-83" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-contextual; font-weight: 400; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;# 为什么要切多头&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-contextual; font-weight: 400; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;instead of performing a single attention function with dmodel-dimensional keys, values and queries,&lt;br&gt;we found it beneficial to linearly project(线性投影) the queries, keys and values h times with different, learned&lt;br&gt;linear projections to dk, dk and dv dimensions, respectively. On each of these projected versions of&lt;br&gt;queries, keys and values we then &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-contextual; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;perform the attention function in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-contextual; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;parallel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-contextual; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-contextual; font-weight: 400; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; yielding dv-dimensional&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;" parent="Yvl_u48jdwtjXfyFhl5y-207" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1020" y="100.5" width="250" height="489.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Yvl_u48jdwtjXfyFhl5y-99" value="&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;1. 线性投影&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9em; overflow: auto; padding: calc(0.888889em); word-break: initial; color: rgb(25, 27, 31);&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;border-radius: 0px; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Andale Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;lucida console&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;&quot; class=&quot;language-python3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot; class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600; color: rgb(9, 64, 142);&quot; class=&quot;nc&quot;&gt;LinearProjection&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;nn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot; class=&quot;o&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Module&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot; class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600; color: rgb(217, 83, 80);&quot; class=&quot;nf&quot;&gt;__init__&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(145, 150, 161);&quot; class=&quot;bp&quot;&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;in_dim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;out_dim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;        &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(23, 114, 246);&quot; class=&quot;nb&quot;&gt;super&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot; class=&quot;o&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;fm&quot;&gt;__init__&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;        &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(145, 150, 161);&quot; class=&quot;bp&quot;&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot; class=&quot;o&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;projection&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot; class=&quot;o&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;nn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot; class=&quot;o&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;in_dim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;out_dim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;    &lt;br&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot; class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600; color: rgb(217, 83, 80);&quot; class=&quot;nf&quot;&gt;forward&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(145, 150, 161);&quot; class=&quot;bp&quot;&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;        &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot; class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(145, 150, 161);&quot; class=&quot;bp&quot;&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot; class=&quot;o&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;projection&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#f5f5f5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#333333;" parent="Yvl_u48jdwtjXfyFhl5y-207" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="500" width="380" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Yvl_u48jdwtjXfyFhl5y-100" value="&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;2. 非线性投影&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: initial; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9em; overflow: auto; padding: calc(0.888889em); word-break: initial; color: rgb(25, 27, 31);&quot;&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: initial; background: rgb(248, 248, 250); border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9em; overflow: auto; padding: calc(0.888889em); word-break: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: inherit; border-radius: 0px; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Andale Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;lucida console&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;&quot; class=&quot;language-text&quot;&gt;class NonLinearProjection(nn.Module):&lt;br&gt;    def __init__(self, in_dim, hidden_dim, out_dim):&lt;br&gt;        super().__init__()&lt;br&gt;        self.projection = nn.Sequential(&lt;br&gt;            nn.Linear(in_dim, hidden_dim),&lt;br&gt;            nn.ReLU(),&lt;br&gt;            nn.Linear(hidden_dim, out_dim)&lt;br&gt;        )&lt;br&gt;    &lt;br&gt;    def forward(self, x):&lt;br&gt;        return self.projection(x)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#f5f5f5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#333333;" parent="Yvl_u48jdwtjXfyFhl5y-207" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="500" y="191.5" width="380" height="198.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Yvl_u48jdwtjXfyFhl5y-101" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 1.4em 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot; data-pid=&quot;N9aB77w-&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;3. 注意力投影&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin: 1em 0px;&quot; class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; margin: 0px; overflow-wrap: initial; border-radius: 4px; overflow: auto; padding: calc(0.888889em); word-break: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11.7px;&quot;&gt;class AttentionProjection(nn.Module):   &lt;br&gt;    def __init__(self, dim):        &lt;br&gt;        super().__init__()        &lt;br&gt;        self.q_proj = nn.Linear(dim, dim)        &lt;br&gt;        self.k_proj = nn.Linear(dim, dim)        &lt;br&gt;        self.v_proj = nn.Linear(dim, dim)            &lt;br&gt;    def forward(self, x):        &lt;br&gt;        q = self.q_proj(x)        &lt;br&gt;        k = self.k_proj(x)        &lt;br&gt;        v = self.v_proj(x)        &lt;br&gt;        return q, k, v&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;-apple-system, system-ui, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, Noto Sans CJK SC, WenQuanYi Micro Hei, MiSans L3, Segoe UI, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 0.9em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#f5f5f5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=default;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="Yvl_u48jdwtjXfyFhl5y-207" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="500" y="420" width="380" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Yvl_u48jdwtjXfyFhl5y-103" value="&lt;h2 style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: 500; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 0px 0px calc(1.16667em); clear: left; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-size: 1.2em;&quot; data-first-child=&quot;&quot;&gt;projection(投影)的关键作用：&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 1.4em 0px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium;&quot; data-pid=&quot;MJjw3jDa&quot;&gt;1. 维度转换&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 1.4em 0px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium;&quot; data-pid=&quot;U9XrAhFT&quot;&gt;将高维数据映射到低维空间，实现降维。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 1.4em 0px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium;&quot; data-pid=&quot;_SVZn53Q&quot;&gt;将低维数据映射到高维空间，增加特征表达能力。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 1.4em 0px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium;&quot; data-pid=&quot;Tt0EHrCX&quot;&gt;将不同维度的&lt;a style=&quot;text-decoration-line: none; color: rgb(9, 64, 142); cursor: pointer;&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=251821940&amp;amp;content_type=Article&amp;amp;match_order=1&amp;amp;q=%E7%89%B9%E5%BE%81%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4&amp;amp;zhida_source=entity&quot; data-paste-text=&quot;true&quot; data-za-not-track-link=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;RichContent-EntityWord css-b7erz1&quot;&gt;特征空间&lt;svg fill=&quot;currentColor&quot; class=&quot;ZDI ZDI--FourPointedStar16 css-1dvsrp&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; height=&quot;10px&quot; width=&quot;10px&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;m5.068 9.267-3.08-.77a.512.512 0 0 1 0-.994l3.08-.77a2.289 2.289 0 0 0 1.665-1.665l.77-3.08a.512.512 0 0 1 .994 0l.77 3.08c.205.82.845 1.46 1.665 1.665l3.08.77a.512.512 0 0 1 0 .994l-3.08.77a2.29 2.29 0 0 0-1.665 1.665l-.77 3.08a.512.512 0 0 1-.994 0l-.77-3.08a2.289 2.289 0 0 0-1.665-1.665Z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;统一到相同维度，便于后续处理。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: -0.8em 0px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium;&quot; class=&quot;ztext-empty-paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 1.4em 0px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium;&quot; data-pid=&quot;9N3U4l-k&quot;&gt;2. 特征变换&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 1.4em 0px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium;&quot; data-pid=&quot;nDYv8ZUL&quot;&gt;改变特征的表示方式，比如将离散特征转换为连续特征。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 1.4em 0px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium;&quot; data-pid=&quot;nDYv8ZUL&quot;&gt;提取更有意义的特征表示。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 1.4em 0px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium;&quot; data-pid=&quot;N0NOWPhQ&quot;&gt;增强特征之间的关系建模。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: -0.8em 0px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium;&quot; class=&quot;ztext-empty-paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 1.4em 0px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium;&quot; data-pid=&quot;BjChLZDt&quot;&gt;3. 计算效率&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 1.4em 0px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium;&quot; data-pid=&quot;rEIjrBMB&quot;&gt;通过降维减少计算量。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 1.4em 0px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium;&quot; data-pid=&quot;lp7w8jQx&quot;&gt;压缩模型参数。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 1.4em 0px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium;&quot; data-pid=&quot;HnfaMFx5&quot;&gt;加速训练和推理过程。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;convertToSvg=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;labelBackgroundColor=none;" parent="Yvl_u48jdwtjXfyFhl5y-207" vertex="1">
